{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：13:39 2026-11-09 HKT<br/>發佈時間：13:39 2026-11-09 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：13:39 2026-11-09 HKT</p><img alt=\"日本茨城地震外海現5.9級震，深度僅10公里，無海嘯風險。日本氣象廳\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/948f561a78913e9997871107483e7c70/2026-11/KF_-Sam_-_2026-11-09T133451_274.png\"/><p>日本外海於當地時間今日（9日）下午1時52分左右，發生黎克特制5.9級地震，震央位於茨城縣外海，震源深度僅10公里。宮城縣、福島縣、茨城縣及栃木縣部分地區均觀測到最大震度3級。日本氣象廳表示，是次地震並無引發海嘯風險。<br/> </p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.322708+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":192,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T05:39:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T10:16:02.513432+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:36.022506+00:00","content_hash":"9aaef8fe0d6512400b10ecc58961b4ee98579029b0d02e8fdb24d5e518e689a2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}